tip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers_loot\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers loot\">Upgradeable - Tier 3</a>: This item is a Tier 3 upgradable item.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Lifedrinker\" title=\"Lifedrinker\">Lifedrinker</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Lifedrinker\" title=\"Lifedrinker\">Lifedrinker</a>:</b> This weapon uses the power of water to draw out the life essence of its targets. On an attack roll of 20 which is confirmed as a critical hit, this power comes to the surface, granting 25 <a href=\"/page/Temporary_hit_point\" title=\"Temporary hit point\">temporary hit points</a> to the wielder and dealing 25 to 45 damage to the target. Creatures with the Fire trait take double this damage instead.</span></span></li>\n<li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment purple\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Purple Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Purple_augments\" title=\"Category:Purple augments\">Purple</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Calomel_Banded_Heavy_Repeater.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Calomel_Banded_Heavy_Repeater.png/420px-Epic_Calomel_Banded_Heavy_Repeater.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"625\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Calomel_Banded_Heavy_Repeater.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The white Calomel ore bands on the lath of this crossbow are always sheathed in condensed water droplets. It is particularly effective against dragons and fiery creatures.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>All ranged Calomel weapons have Lifedrinker <b>Guard</b>, not Lifedrinker.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816191950\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.182 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5899/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61799/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20541/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0